        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                "word": "по-домашнему",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28b6b659-cf76-30d8-a208-0bb5287a13b3",
                        "entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. так, как принято до́ма, как бывает, как делают до́ма"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd880b0e-0d4a-4b7b-9934-610bda5d6b89",
                                "sense_id": "28b6b659-cf76-30d8-a208-0bb5287a13b3",
                                "text": "Дети размещаются в уютных помещениях, имеют все необходимые удобства, обеспечены калорийным и по-домашнему вкусным питанием."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2348d6be-38e0-39b7-a5c7-476e318fd3e5",
                        "entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. просто, непринуждённо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8352f913-ac3e-41ff-a839-c0e4941c9578",
                                "sense_id": "2348d6be-38e0-39b7-a5c7-476e318fd3e5",
                                "text": "Борис Леонидович был по-домашнему заботлив и приветлив, разговорчив, говорил всякие приятные вещи, следил, чтобы я ела."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4232817-7be5-4b6a-afab-97b4535c6c06",
                                "sense_id": "2348d6be-38e0-39b7-a5c7-476e318fd3e5",
                                "text": "У меня всё по-домашнему, — нежно сказала она, подняв на меня глаза (то ли агатовые, то ли фиалковые, уже не помню, но точно прекрасные) — я сделаю ужин, как мама нас с братом кормила, когда мы были маленькие…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c9688ff-7140-42c6-b574-52773852e21c",
                        "source_entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "source_sense_description": "так, как принято до́ма, как как делают до́ма",
                        "target_lang_word": "homely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "homely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "253aa4a2-3b83-3d10-b52a-93f0246d7972",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characteristic of, belonging to, or befitting a home; domestic, cosy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b91c552-095c-4df4-93b2-4b87a0a6f5da",
                                                "sense_id": "253aa4a2-3b83-3d10-b52a-93f0246d7972",
                                                "text": "An interesting illustration of this is the way in which the English flower names which were in use till very recently are being ousted by Greek ones, snapdragon becoming antirrhinum, forget-me-not becoming myosotis, etc. It is hard to see any practical reason for this change of fashion: it is probably due to an instinctive turning-away from the more homely word and a vague feeling that the Greek word is scientific."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbeec39c-71db-4b97-9b45-651c302c039f",
                                                "sense_id": "253aa4a2-3b83-3d10-b52a-93f0246d7972",
                                                "text": "Other homely details in the stories — preparing a salad, diapering a baby"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1f4156b-40ed-4d48-a0a0-99a69ecb8fba",
                                                "sense_id": "253aa4a2-3b83-3d10-b52a-93f0246d7972",
                                                "text": "Mowgli: \"Oh, don't worry Chota, it may not be homely, but I can warm it up.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5e07ac2-feae-39a2-ac1d-b066e4bae98f",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking in beauty or elegance, plain in appearance, physically unattractive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0bc4876-6043-45c2-ba9a-ad3bdbf15013",
                                                "sense_id": "f5e07ac2-feae-39a2-ac1d-b066e4bae98f",
                                                "text": "There is none so homely but loves a looking-glass."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47504393-ae5b-4b64-b00a-6e36b0d6c6bf",
                                                "sense_id": "f5e07ac2-feae-39a2-ac1d-b066e4bae98f",
                                                "text": "\"I can't send a young, pretty girl, or for that matter even a homely one if you'd have her, on a job like this without telling her what to expect.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18f3bc93-8111-4ad0-a06b-934f0de1c376",
                                                "sense_id": "f5e07ac2-feae-39a2-ac1d-b066e4bae98f",
                                                "text": "You see, she sees herself as a starlet; I see her as a sturdy, healthy but decidedly homely kid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7b44c4a-29ae-3d3b-9efa-788b556ce469",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On intimate or friendly terms with (someone); familiar; at home (with a person); intimate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "455a0c38-e007-429e-ad0e-d84b86a24757",
                                                "sense_id": "b7b44c4a-29ae-3d3b-9efa-788b556ce469",
                                                "text": "With all these men I was right homely, and communed with them long and oft."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be91046e-b298-3d43-8bf7-442bd6bf6451",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Domestic; tame."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "035d89a8-77dc-3008-9328-2842ed06c316",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personal; private."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84370733-ac14-3223-a30c-99a4b4b19497",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Friendly; kind; gracious; cordial."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f2430c4-d326-35bb-b325-0d039331cc4b",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conservative and family-oriented."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f10ad8e1-898a-468d-a670-f8dd0ad0a191",
                                                "sense_id": "8f2430c4-d326-35bb-b325-0d039331cc4b",
                                                "text": "I am seeking a beautiful homely girl for marriage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                        "entry_id": "0a2b10ca-5ffb-3ca4-9bfc-ea6088ed2683",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Simple; plain; familiar; unelaborate; unadorned."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "490d4c50-6e24-4720-9198-e46d89f36081",
                                                "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                                "text": "Now Strephon daily entertains\n His Chloe in the homeliest strains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae1b516e-3fca-41b0-aa57-a1f3463674fc",
                                                "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                                "text": "There is no simple way to define precisely a complex arrangement of parts, however homely the object may appear to be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9761b73c-0c27-4e2f-9a5e-eeabbbaa3bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                                "text": "a homely garment"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4fcc11c-8c3f-45d6-86b2-74c8f4ec10d5",
                                                "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                                "text": "homely fare"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9298e079-6d36-42bd-8db5-0527f7d9da83",
                                                "sense_id": "fbb066ca-47de-3f47-9fc6-d2710ad597ff",
                                                "text": "homely manners"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e522d18b-95e9-4ad1-b5f9-aa42ef157400",
                        "source_entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "source_sense_description": "так, как принято до́ма, как как делают до́ма",
                        "target_lang_word": "domestically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "domestically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "769ccdec-b41d-312e-8ac8-b12b0ddd2574",
                                        "entry_id": "02bb1076-c483-3429-b201-816b2cb2ee01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a domestic manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82ea07bd-7647-4eaa-83d3-006b433cef20",
                                                "sense_id": "769ccdec-b41d-312e-8ac8-b12b0ddd2574",
                                                "text": "The wind-down of OPIC is also consistent with the President’s commitment to focus less overseas and more domestically, and will achieve savings in OPIC’s administrative and subsidy expenses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "363424a9-a727-3d6e-bb90-25b1439541a1",
                                        "entry_id": "02bb1076-c483-3429-b201-816b2cb2ee01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At home, playing in one's home ground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcfbf38c-10d4-427d-acd3-fe973584a6b1",
                                                "sense_id": "363424a9-a727-3d6e-bb90-25b1439541a1",
                                                "text": "Athletic have been showing signs of fatigue domestically and they never quite seemed to reach the same pitch of intensity that had so unsettled Manchester United and Schalke 04 in earlier rounds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6fb90439-abe2-4e0c-a588-5f4ce1aa3b89",
                        "source_entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "source_sense_description": "так, как принято до́ма, как как делают до́ма",
                        "target_lang_word": "cosily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cosily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8456985-b6dd-33b1-95af-44bf595a2b10",
                                        "entry_id": "80ddcc5c-9a3c-3c80-a1ce-783e34132caa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a cosy manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66314ad2-bb20-4f18-b237-10003e64925d",
                                                "sense_id": "a8456985-b6dd-33b1-95af-44bf595a2b10",
                                                "text": "This brought them to the fireside, where the easy-chair was drawn cosily up, and the tea things stood ready to the sitter’s elbow, the very sugar in the cup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c77cd5b-464d-4d66-bb26-078112339553",
                                                "sense_id": "a8456985-b6dd-33b1-95af-44bf595a2b10",
                                                "text": "It's hard to put your hands into the pockets of a suit coat. Mine were tucked away cosily in the deep pockets of my zipped-up leather jacket."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "642ce1fa-3ac5-4f3c-b6a5-415069956d85",
                        "source_entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
                        "source_sense_description": "просто, непринуждённо",
                        "target_lang_word": "simply",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simply",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d47a07a-ad66-3934-90dd-1b9f73795e4a",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a simple way or state; considered in or by itself; without addition; alone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b66f9c70-a612-388b-bf5e-9152a8accd68",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plainly; without art or subtlety"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6239f6ba-01b4-3d8b-a5e8-60eb17e413e7",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Foolishly; stupidly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "454d6451-9736-47ee-8ab1-11a1dd0f16a8",
                                                "sense_id": "6239f6ba-01b4-3d8b-a5e8-60eb17e413e7",
                                                "text": "Mrs. Thorold had told her sons that a young lady was visiting at the house, whose history she had given them in short hand, describing her as a dependent on the late Mrs. Willoughby, whom her son had very simply intended to marry at Alvestone […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f21e9594-f93f-34fe-8037-bba7a97eff1c",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Merely; solely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "focus"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfd31c40-ee5f-45ef-9d10-293011cade0f",
                                                "sense_id": "f21e9594-f93f-34fe-8037-bba7a97eff1c",
                                                "text": "I was simply asking a question."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cd986d7-c28f-422e-8cc3-199fa000c23f",
                                                "sense_id": "f21e9594-f93f-34fe-8037-bba7a97eff1c",
                                                "text": "A “moving platform” scheme[…]is more technologically ambitious than maglev trains even though it relies on conventional rails.[…]This set-up solves several problems […]. Stopping high-speed trains wastes energy and time, so why not simply slow them down enough for a moving platform to pull alongside?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5340c159-097f-40d5-b230-737c3eb94215",
                                                "sense_id": "f21e9594-f93f-34fe-8037-bba7a97eff1c",
                                                "text": "Rather than scanning a boarding pass or handing over a passport, you simply stare into a camera and you’re verified."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea90e5ba-1156-3ff1-9e79-34b5f130a638",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "absolutely, positively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d513240-f09e-41a1-876c-467b420ad4ed",
                                                "sense_id": "ea90e5ba-1156-3ff1-9e79-34b5f130a638",
                                                "text": "That was a simply wonderful dessert."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f3747f7-c95a-4ac2-9b0f-57c0eeb5ab57",
                                                "sense_id": "ea90e5ba-1156-3ff1-9e79-34b5f130a638",
                                                "text": "What about the way you love me? / And the way you squeeze me? / Simply beautiful"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a62f13d8-c8e9-3a75-86a4-b896b73ab361",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ae3883-ae84-34cb-8900-f8772cb30265",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Frankly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b4fdc9-320f-49d4-be2a-7e06164b600c",
                                                "sense_id": "a62f13d8-c8e9-3a75-86a4-b896b73ab361",
                                                "text": "Simply, he just fired you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa264ac2-ec5b-4776-9347-181e32583095",
                        "source_entry_id": "126ebff8-3419-366b-9a65-033752391ff9",
